{"id":"643201","name":"虾仁炒饭","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/643201/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"虾仁","amount":"适量"},{"name":"剩米饭","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鲜虾去壳后洗净切小块。","img":"images/643201/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"虾仁加入适量花生油，胡椒粉抓匀静置。","img":"images/643201/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"香葱洗净切葱花备用。","img":"images/643201/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"剩米饭一碗备用。","img":"images/643201/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"米饭打入一个鸡蛋。","img":"images/643201/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"拆匀让米饭均匀裹上蛋液。","img":"images/643201/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"热锅下油放入米饭。","img":"images/643201/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"翻炒均匀至米饭粒粒分明后盛出。","img":"images/643201/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"锅中热油放入虾仁翻炒至变色。","img":"images/643201/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入炒过的米饭。","img":"images/643201/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"少许盐调味翻炒均匀。","img":"images/643201/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"出锅前加入葱花即可。","img":"images/643201/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/643201/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/643201/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}